# 10.1 shipped

**Patch 0040** — dialog framework + `chrome://slayzone-dialogs/<id>` WebUI.

Landed:
- `chrome://slayzone-dialogs/` host (C++ SlayzoneDialogsUI + host) binding DialogHost Mojo.
- DialogHost forwards `Resolve(invocation_id, result_json)` + `Cancel(invocation_id)` to sidecar (`dialog:resolve` / `dialog:cancel` JSON-RPC).
- Outer bundle `packages/webui/dialogs/` — URL routes `/<dialogId>?invocation=<uuid>&props=<base64url-json>` → lazy-loaded component; UnknownDialog fallback.
- Mojom source-of-truth + in-tree mirror + regenerated TS bindings.
- Tests: 7/7 green (`App.test.tsx` + `invocation.test.ts`).
- Chromium framework built clean; outer typecheck clean.

Outer commit: `919bc0b5`. In-tree commit: `dba90e0d`.

