## Invoker channel
No invoker-side wiring yet. Sidecar needs two new handlers:
- `dialog:open` (invoker-side): register invocation_id → props, return URL to open
- `dialog:resolve` + `dialog:cancel` handlers: complete the pending invocation future

These are orthogonal to 10.1 framework and should land alongside the first real-dialog port (10.2).
